# A child's detach: its alerts go, each with a REMOVED entry queued for the metadata thread; the host's flag and the
# charts' ask for them again; a pass with the gate closed does nothing. The reconnect: linked again with the old
# ids and next event ids, UNINITIALIZED, then WARNING, and what the notification scan makes of the new entries.
database real
queue 1
rules tests/corpus/notify/two.conf
chart loop.n loop.n_name loop.notify disks things 1
var loop.n v 70
clock 0
pass 0
store
clock 1
pass 1
store
clock 2
disconnect
clock 3
pass 3
store
clock 4
pass 4
health-enabled 1
gate 1
clock 5
pass 5
store
clock 6
pass 6
store
clock 7
pass 7
store
